'''Kiawe''' (Japanese: '''カキ''' ''Kaki'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Choose 1 of your {{TCGP|Marowak|Alolan Marowak}} or {{TCGP|Turtonator}}. Take 2 {{e|Fire}} Energy from your Energy Zone and attach it to that Pokémon. Your turn ends.
}}

