==Trivia==
* This card's effect is somewhat similar to {{TCG|Kiawe}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], in that they both attach multiple {{e|Fire}} Energy to a single Pokémon, and end the turn afterward. However, the TCG card attaches up to 4 {{e|Fire}} Energy (from the Deck rather than Energy Zone) to any single Pokémon, rather than specifically Alolan Marowak or Turtonator.

===Origin===
*[[Kiawe]] is a [[Trial Captain|captain]] in the [[Generation VII]] [[Pokémon games]]. The [[Wela Volcano Park]] Totem Den is featured in the illustration.

